sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Pod dns-client (dev)
  participant D as CoreDNS
  participant S as Service api-shared (shared)
  participant B as Pod backend (shared)

  P->>D: Consulta api-shared.shared.svc.cluster.local
  D-->>P: Retorna ClusterIP do Service
  P->>S: HTTP GET /
  S->>B: Encaminha para backend
  B-->>P: "api shared namespace"
